cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the accompanying paper when using this work, and this repository when using the partial Lean formalization."
type: software
title: "An Upper Bound Exponent of 0.9999873 for Square-Difference-Free Sets"
authors:
  - family-names: Naslund
    given-names: Eric
    email: naslund.math@gmail.com
repository-code: https://github.com/enaslund/sarkozy-upper-bound-0.9999875
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  The manuscript proves an explicit power-saving upper bound for
  square-difference-free subsets of the integers. The companion Lean
  development proves a conditional bound with exponent 0.99999; it is
  not a complete formalization of the manuscript's theorem.
